# Access-control tests use two disposable accounts. authToken belongs to profileUserId.
# Set otherTestUserId and otherTestAuthToken to a different disposable account.
# Seed one bookmark, one rating and one structured search for account A before checking list isolation.
# Run each account A capture before its corresponding account B check.

